Unicode name-alias data
----------------------

The Rust core includes name-alias profile membership generated from the official Unicode Character Database versions 13.0, 14.0, 15.0, 15.1 and 16.0.
Copyright (c) 1991-2026 Unicode, Inc.
The data is licensed under Unicode-3.0.
The client distribution's THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES-RUST.txt reproduces its terms, generated by scripts/rust_core/rust_notices.py.
The first-party generator scripts/rust_core/generate_direct_unicode.py records pinned official input hashes and derived byte hashes in rust/crates/sdm-request/data/UNICODE-PROVENANCE.json.
No third-party code is vendored for this lookup.
